--[[
    KAMUI - Macro / Backdash Cancel + Magnet

    FEATURES:
    - Backdash Cancel 1-4
    - Individual macro enable/disable
    - Custom keybinds
    - Magnet ON/OFF
    - Magnet Delay editable by typing
    - Closest player/NPC detection within 23 horizontal studs
    - Magnet pull after Backdash Cancel
    - Attach/follow the selected target during Magnet

    MAGNET DELAY:
    Type the desired delay directly into the Magnet Delay box.
    Examples:
        0      = instant
        0.05   = 0.05 seconds
        0.10   = 0.10 seconds
        0.25   = 0.25 seconds
        1      = 1 second
]]

